  <!-- home page -->
  <data name="Home_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Fili.ReadyTemplate: Project Overview</value></data>
  <data name="Home_Notice_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>is a continuation of ReadySET 0.9.3, the last version of Jason Robbins' template library published at readyset.tigris.org before Tigris.org shut down. The pages have been converted to HTML5 with a modern stylesheet, the links that died with Tigris repointed to this site or to the Internet Archive, and the site can now be read in more than one language. The template content is the ReadySET original, under the</value></data>
