  <data name="Home_Notice_Disclaimer" xml:space="preserve"><value>This continuation is not affiliated with or endorsed by its author. See the</value></data>
  <data name="Home_Notice_ReleaseNotesLink" xml:space="preserve"><value>release notes</value></data>
  <data name="Home_Notice_GitHubLink" xml:space="preserve"><value>Source, downloads and an issue tracker are on GitHub</value></data>
  <data name="Home_OriginalOverviewNote" xml:space="preserve"><value>The sections below are the original ReadySET project overview, kept as Jason Robbins wrote it in 2004; "ReadySET" and "this project" in them refer to that project.</value></data>
  <data name="Quick_Browse" xml:space="preserve"><value>Browse templates</value></data>
